---
/**
 * The site footer (#91): a generic copyright, set in the editorial face on
 * the editorial ground.
 *
 * BaseLayout renders this outside .screen, so it is the page's single
 * contentinfo landmark and is identical across page types, /chat included
 * since B2 Phase 2 (#108).
 *
 * The theme toggle (#92) MOVED to the header's identity row (item 7); the
 * footer no longer carries it. The row keeps just the copyright now.
 *
 * The year is literal on purpose (Brian's exact string). Deriving it from the
 * build date would self-maintain, but that is his call to make, not ours.
 */
---

<footer class="sfoot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>
      &copy; 2026 Brian Rohde <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a class="dimlink" href="/credits">credits</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
